# The gantry link on the PCB driller (machine/retrofit/pcbdrill_glink.portal,
# the default current loop): a 2 g move, then a slow pass back (where the Y
# drives fell into a 227 Hz fight without the link).
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/retrofit/pcbdrill_glink.portal
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 0.5 200 150
run 0.3
trapfrac 0.5
tmove 0.3 200 450
run 0.3
mark
move 7.5 200 150
print max_cur_y1 max_cur_y2 max_rack fault_code
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 < 1.2
@expect portal.max_cur_y2 < 1.2
@expect portal.max_rack < 15
@expect portal.fault_code == 0
@reject ^ERROR
